.PP
"no post-processing operations for REGION were defined in derived PDE_Integrator" 
.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class CELLTYPE> void \fBcsmp::PDE_Integrator_CRM\fP< dim, CELLTYPE >::ReduceSystemSizeEliminatingEssentialConditions (const \fBModelSubDomain\fP< dim, CELLTYPE > & gref, size_t total_degrees_of_freedom)\fR [protected]\fP"

